{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38949","headline":"赠友人罢举赴辟命 · 杜荀鹤","name":"赠友人罢举赴辟命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连天一水浸吴东，十幅帆飞二月风。\n好景采抛诗句里，别愁驱入酒杯中。\n渔依岸柳眠圆影，鸟傍岩花戏暖红。\n不是桂枝终不得，自缘年少好从戎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}